 MULTI-AGENT ARCHITECTURE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Every user message flows through a SUPERVISOR → SPECIALIST pipeline:

  User Message
       │
       ▼
  SupervisorAgent  (GPT-4o, temp=0, classifies intent)
       │
       ├── legal_research → LegalResearchAgent
       │     Embeds query → pgvector RPC → retrieves top chunks
       │     GPT-4o synthesizes answer with citations
       │
       ├── intake        → IntakeAgent
       │     Trauma-informed guided Q&A
       │     Collects: issue type, jurisdiction, dates, parties, urgency
       │
       ├── drafting      → DraftingAgent
       │     Generates: demand letters, motions, complaints,
       │     accommodation requests, cease & desist
       │     Always adds legal disclaimer footer
       │
       └── escalation    → EscalationAgent
             Detects: danger, DV, lockouts, child safety, self-harm
             Actions: DB flag, Slack alert, Resend email, crisis resources

  BaseAgent: abstract base with _safe_run() error wrapper + logging
  All agents accept: user_message, history, case_id, user_id

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 DOCUMENT INGESTION PIPELINE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  POST /api/v1/documents/upload
       │
       ▼
  Validate (type: pdf/docx/txt/md, size: ≤50MB)
  Save to disk → Insert document record (status: pending)
       │
       ▼
  Celery Task: ingest_document_task
       ├── parser.py   → extract plain text (pypdf / python-docx / open())
       ├── chunker.py  → tiktoken split (512 tokens, 64 overlap)
       ├── embedder.py → OpenAI text-embedding-3-small (batches of 100)
       └── Supabase    → upsert document_chunks + mark status: ready

  CLI: python -m app.ingestion.runner --file doc.pdf
       python -m app.ingestion.runner --dir ./legal_docs/

